The following files are adapted from that project and have been MODIFIED from
the original. Notably, this version targets the Claude Code CLI rather than the
Codex app-server:

  - SPEC.md     — the specification. The agent-runner contract (Section 10) and
                  the `claude` configuration block (Section 5.3.6) are specific
                  to Claude Code.
  - WORKFLOW.md — the sample workflow. It uses a `claude:` configuration block in
                  place of `codex:`, and the prompt drops Codex-specific skills
                  and paths.

